        Carries its own domain and Pages project **because the Docs SKU is licensed and reviewed independently on the Chrome Web Store, and its Preserve Page Colors / Kix-canvas screenshots are the specific proof this buyer needs before purchase**. Its build is triggered by the change-detection stage of the landing deploy workflow, and the Docs extension's `landing-bridge.js` content script matches this domain so post-checkout token handoff works from the product's own site.
