        summary "Hero, Features, Pricing, FAQ, ScreenshotShowcase, Nav, Footer, ProductCard, SetupGuide, PromoTile and the shared dark-theme stylesheet."
        description '''
          The component library that all five marketing sites are built from, because darklysuite.com, gmaildarkly.com, sheetsdarkly.com, docsdarkly.com and browsedarkly.com are separate Cloudflare Pages deployments that must stay visually and commercially identical. Every component is prop-driven so a site supplies its own copy, icons and screenshots.
        
          `Pricing` carries the commercial logic: it renders three tiers per product, and on the suite site switches into a dual mode with an app selector plus a bundle-versus-individual comparison table — the on-page expression of the bundle upsell. `SubscribeContent` is the post-install landing that routes through the Google OAuth checkout URL so Stripe gets a verified email. `ScreenshotShowcase` renders hero and feature screenshot grids with a keyboard-dismissable lightbox, consuming the images produced by the screenshot harness. `SetupGuide` covers post-install activation. Chrome Web Store links per product are passed in as `storeUrls`.
